          "concern": "Release-to-ESR merge behavior lacks from-repo, so a hard-coded source lookup fails; different transitions need different source/upstream/tag choices.",
          "response": "The full retained main bug starts with KeyError: from-repo. D215538 records early July acceptance and backout, revised August explicit acceptance, September backout and later reland. The author recalls central-to-beta breakage for the first backout; its exact mechanism is not established. Earlier reported successful Try runs are distinct from later changes.",
